---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="BitEvo — Consulting & Agent Authority Audit" description="BitEvo engineering audit and bounded consulting services for AI-agent authority, evidence and controls.">
  <section class="consulting-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="consulting-header">
        <div class="kicker">Engineering Services</div>
        <h1 class="display">Services & Offerings</h1>
        <p class="copy">Evidence-bounded engineering work for AI-agent authority, traceability, logging and operational controls. Claims are limited to what can be reproduced from the agreed test scope.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="services-grid">
        <article class="service-card highlighted">
          <div class="service-meta">Primary · Fixed scope</div>
          <h2>Agent Authority & Evidence Audit</h2>
          <p>5 рабочих дней, 1 staging/test workflow, до 3 tools / APIs / MCP servers и 10–20 согласованных failure scenarios.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Authority/action-chain review and bounded failure testing.</li>
            <li>Executive report + reproducible evidence pack.</li>
            <li>Prioritized repair backlog + one retest.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">$4,900 fixed</div>
          <a class="button highlight-btn" href="/agent-authority-audit">Audit details</a>
        </article>

        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-meta">Entry · Reduced scope</div>
          <h2>Reduced-Scope Entry Audit</h2>
          <p>Одна critical action chain и одна main failure hypothesis с ограниченным воспроизведением и коротким finding memo.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>No full authority map.</li>
            <li>No included retest.</li>
            <li>Written scope required before testing.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">$1,500 fixed</div>
          <a class="button" href="/audit-intake">Open intake</a>
        </article>

        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-meta">Free · Qualification</div>
          <h2>Scope / Authority Triage</h2>
          <p>20-минутный разговор для определения критического действия агента, доступной test/staging среды и того, подходит ли кейс для аудита.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>No written security conclusion.</li>
            <li>No exploit work.</li>
            <li>No deep log analysis.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">Free · 20 min</div>
          <a class="button" href="/audit-intake">Start triage</a>
        </article>

        <article class="service-card">
          <div class="service-meta">After findings</div>
          <h2>Hardening / Repair</h2>
          <p>Ремедиация оценивается отдельно после verified findings. До аудита фиксированная цена внедрения публично не обещается.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Scope follows verified findings.</li>
            <li>Change risk and rollback are assessed per repair.</li>
            <li>Retest criteria are tied to the finding.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="price">Quoted separately</div>
          <a class="button" href="/pricing">See pricing rules</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="boundary">
        <strong>Boundary:</strong> this is an engineering audit, not certification or legal advice. It does not guarantee security, absence of defects, or production safety. Production penetration testing is not included by default.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .consulting-section{padding-block:48px 60px}.consulting-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:38px}.kicker{color:var(--gold);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.display{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:2.5rem;margin:6px 0 10px}.copy{font-family:'Lora',serif;color:var(--muted);max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}.services-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;max-width:1040px;margin-inline:auto}.service-card{background:var(--paper-soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.service-card.highlighted{border-color:rgba(189,179,146,.55)}.service-meta{font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px}.service-card h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 0 12px}.service-card p,.service-card li{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}.service-card ul{padding-left:18px;margin:0 0 24px}.price{font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:900;margin-top:auto;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:16px}.button{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:8px;font-weight:800}.highlight-btn{background:var(--gold);color:#080a0b}.boundary{max-width:1040px;margin:26px auto 0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;color:var(--muted)}.boundary strong{color:var(--gold)}@media(max-width:780px){.services-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
